From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:04:32 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon: update file intro comments to call DAMON just DAMON

DAMON source code file intro comments call DAMON Data Access Monitor.
Since introduction of DAMOS, DAMON has been somewhat more than Data
Access Monitor.  Update the comments to call it just DAMON.  Also some
of the comments are not appropriate.  Update those together.

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/core.c              | 2 +-
 mm/damon/ops-common.c        | 2 +-
 mm/damon/ops-common.h        | 2 +-
 mm/damon/tests/core-kunit.h  | 2 +-
 mm/damon/tests/paddr-kunit.h | 2 +-
 mm/damon/tests/sysfs-kunit.h | 2 +-
 mm/damon/tests/vaddr-kunit.h | 2 +-
 7 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mm/damon/core.c b/mm/damon/core.c
index e5740b6af9ef8..f82ef22315751 100644
--- a/mm/damon/core.c
+++ b/mm/damon/core.c
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
 /*
- * Data Access Monitor
+ * DAMON Core
  */
 
 #define pr_fmt(fmt) "damon: " fmt
diff --git a/mm/damon/ops-common.c b/mm/damon/ops-common.c
index 2216a0023154f..38720794c9fcf 100644
--- a/mm/damon/ops-common.c
+++ b/mm/damon/ops-common.c
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
 /*
- * Common Code for Data Access Monitoring
+ * Common Code for DAMON Operation Set
  */
 
 #include <linux/hugetlb.h>
diff --git a/mm/damon/ops-common.h b/mm/damon/ops-common.h
index ee27058251005..aabcf09ff5010 100644
--- a/mm/damon/ops-common.h
+++ b/mm/damon/ops-common.h
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 /* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
 /*
- * Common Code for Data Access Monitoring
+ * Common Code for DAMON Operation Set
  */
 
 #include <linux/damon.h>
diff --git a/mm/damon/tests/core-kunit.h b/mm/damon/tests/core-kunit.h
index 1e829a3248483..5244ac0ffc285 100644
--- a/mm/damon/tests/core-kunit.h
+++ b/mm/damon/tests/core-kunit.h
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 /* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
 /*
- * Data Access Monitor Unit Tests
+ * DAMON Core Unit Tests
  */
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_DAMON_KUNIT_TEST
diff --git a/mm/damon/tests/paddr-kunit.h b/mm/damon/tests/paddr-kunit.h
index 2b11f0e67a12d..547e1b3c989fb 100644
--- a/mm/damon/tests/paddr-kunit.h
+++ b/mm/damon/tests/paddr-kunit.h
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 /* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
 /*
- * Data Access Monitor Unit Tests
+ * DAMON Physical Address Space Operation Set Unit Tests
  */
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_DAMON_PADDR_KUNIT_TEST
diff --git a/mm/damon/tests/sysfs-kunit.h b/mm/damon/tests/sysfs-kunit.h
index 16373ba751dbc..c2bba2e013018 100644
--- a/mm/damon/tests/sysfs-kunit.h
+++ b/mm/damon/tests/sysfs-kunit.h
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 /* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
 /*
- * Data Access Monitor Unit Tests
+ * DAMON sysfs Interface Unit Tests
  */
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_DAMON_SYSFS_KUNIT_TEST
diff --git a/mm/damon/tests/vaddr-kunit.h b/mm/damon/tests/vaddr-kunit.h
index d61b503e319a0..fc92bb1087564 100644
--- a/mm/damon/tests/vaddr-kunit.h
+++ b/mm/damon/tests/vaddr-kunit.h
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 /* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
 /*
- * Data Access Monitor Unit Tests
+ * DAMON Virtaul Address Space Operation Set Unit Tests
  */
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_DAMON_VADDR_KUNIT_TEST
-- 
